Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:06.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,And an order of fries, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No. No fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:08.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, should we head home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you eating?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, fries?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But when did you buy them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's fine! This is their smallest size.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not fine, Elfuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I told you not to get any...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:38.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,64.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.17,0:01:36.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,604.8)}{\an7}A Stagnating Dream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.25,0:01:36.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.63,0:01:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It'd be a shame to waste it.\NLet's get out of the house, Elfuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Loafing around again...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.63,0:01:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elfuda, there's a hole in your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.25,0:01:50.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,453.6)}{\an7}Warring Spuds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.25,0:01:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should we go buy you some new ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:58.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I came prepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:01:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of tracksuits...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Better to have 'em and\Nnot need 'em, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tracksuits are downright incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Moisture-wicking, odor-resistant, breathable...\NThey do it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Loungewear, sleepwear, casual wear...\NYou can wear 'em 24/7!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:14.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And what's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:18.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plain old tracksuits like these are the\Nunofficial uniform of couch potatoes everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you see the a-peel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now you're just reaching...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyway, hurry up and\Nget changed so we can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:28.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,This weather is way too nice\Nto stay cooped up inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so impatient sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't just start undressing in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And up we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human, please don't\Nmention this to Bubble Butt...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:56.04,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844.8,64.8)}{\an7}Try our fresh French fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the place with the French fries\Neveryone raves about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:58.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But you'll spoil your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:03:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... after a long run...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll make you a healthy potato dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just hold out till then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:15.13,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,93.6)}{\an7}Massage Relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:14.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,So what's new?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been doing the stretches you taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pragmatic as always...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:28.04,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1024,72)}{\an7}SQUISH
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your muscles are so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:27.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm on my feet all day. It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:33.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your calves are especially tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The rain...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.83,0:03:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,My gills could do with the extra moisture...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should we wait inside the clinic?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:47.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Welcome! Do you have an appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:54.21,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,50.4)}{\an7}Wheeze, wheeze
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:54.21,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(627.2,100.8)}{\an7}Twitch, twitch
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Until next time then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our turn yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:58.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great timing. I just finished\NKuroeda's treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:02.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're drenched.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Goes to show her circulation's getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.25,0:04:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, squeeze me real good too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you take a break first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'm going on my break after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:17.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your hips are especially tight...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, the tenderloin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:20.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your back, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, the sirloin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:25.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please don't equate her anatomy\Nto different cuts of pork.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not as cute as a precious little piggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:34.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got a spare pair of pants\NI can lend you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,My goodness, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.83,0:04:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not a big fan of thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I nearly forgot.\NIt was raining when we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:55.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, it's perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could I trouble you for a spare shirt too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The cyclops reverted to her natural size?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thunder scary...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:15.00,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,460.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Naoe! Your next client is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:21.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you mind giving me a few-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:24.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww, who's a good girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You seem pretty tense!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'd better work out all these knots!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:31.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:35.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had a ton of clients today...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming to see me, Laika.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But maybe try to show up\Nin human form next time, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:46.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The health deparment has\Na thing about dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,'Kay, see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:54.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Urk-!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:56.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:59.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be suspicious of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well now I'm suspicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to hear me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm kind of in a hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It will only take a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:15.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's about the foolish elven girl\Nwho's been residing at your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:18.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's speak elsewhere. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who ARE you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:30.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This so-called "soft serve"\Nis a delicious treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's as cold as ice and extremely sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The fact that you can access\Nthis delicacy whenever you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems your world has some\Nvery advanced technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,There is no conflict here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Comfortable, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I understand why she wouldn't want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't panic, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,E-Elfuda?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lately I haven't been able to shake the feeling\Nthat someone was watching us...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I guess it wasn't the satyr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take off that mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,The human and I were simply\Nhaving a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're as shallow-minded as ever, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,YOU...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen you in a while,\Nyou rude little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Auntie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's your aunt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a heartfelt reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The arrow was a nice touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:35.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sowwy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,"I haven't heard from my\Ngood-for-nothing daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:41.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Track her down for me," your mother said...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,...but just look at all this blubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not that you WON'T come home,\Nit's that you CAN'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:50.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your mother was worried sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:52.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, there's no need to be violent...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.88,0:07:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You haven't even seen "violent" yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:00.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Getting a little lax happens to the best of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:02.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,but THIS level of flab is inexcusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Despite my insistence that you\Ncorrect your behavior,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,you've continued to demonstrate\Na lack of discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:16.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be staying at\Nyour apartment for a while too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Auntie's my mentor. She taught me\Nhow to handle myself in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:34.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,No gathering firewood or drawing water...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,This technology is convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once her mind is made up,\Nshe won't listen to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay. That's not what bothers me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she here to bring you back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had every intention of\Nreturning in my own time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:55.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But since I can't pass through the gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:58.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,she'll probably give up and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's worry about it in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:18.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,How long do you plan on sleeping\Nwith that unsightly belly poking out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go get dressed and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pick up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:32.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I don't have the energy...\N'cause I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll be reducing your portion sizes and\Ntraining with me for the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:47.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I hear any complaints, you get nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:52.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm starving...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Finish eating.\NWe're going another 5 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:09:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even I can tell you're a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I also realize that your world is\None of ease and comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,However, that doesn't necessarily\Nresult in being a good influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what are you getting at...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,This world is soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that softness has turned her\Ninto a spoiled crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Listen, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:27.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,From now on, she's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:30.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're too soft, so I'll be taking over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The one person who knows\Nwhat's best for her... is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-but...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:41.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She WILL lose weight\Nand she'll do it MY way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,She'll never stand on her own two feet\Nas long as you're around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you'll back off, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next up is strength training!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no time to rest!
